# ui/PaintCacheComponents — a node whose subtree can be drawn from a picture of itself
# (ui/renderSystem/RenderPaintCache, lib/Gpu2dCanvasCache): put it on a canvas of many nodes (the
# Camera2D root). While all of its subtree fits on screen (a canvas zoomed out), the subtree is
# drawn once into a texture the frame's size and then drawn as that one image, moved and scaled
# with the camera, until the content changes or the zoom leaves `zoomOutLimit`..`zoomInLimit`
# times the zoom it was drawn at (then it is drawn again, at the new zoom). When it does not all
# fit (zoomed in), the nodes are drawn as they are. A cached subtree does not animate: a hover or a
# motion inside it shows when the picture is drawn again.
type PaintCache {
  enabled: Bool = true
  zoomInLimit: Float = 1.5
  zoomOutLimit: Float = 0.5
}
